        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Who can touch what once the segregation plan and the portal roles are done. One row per identity, one column per resource by access plane, the CMP portal included.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read a row: everything an identity can do. Read a column: who can touch a resource. A cell empty for another project&amp;#39;s identity is the isolation.&lt;br&gt;Keycloak is the only source: groups give the platform and the portal rights alike. Project owner, admin, member and guest are the project&amp;#39;s groups; owner is the creator.&lt;br&gt;The before and after view is access-matrix. This one shows the end state only.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
